            <span class="text-text-secondary text-sm" data-i18n="models.daddy.period">/month</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed" data-i18n="models.daddy.desc">Three emails, three social platforms. Full AI workforce in your pocket. Like having a personal assistant without the $3,000/month price tag.</p>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-3">
