            <span class="text-text-secondary text-sm" data-i18n="models.bigdaddy.period">/month</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed" data-i18n="models.bigdaddy.desc">Unlimited everything. Your whole life, handled. Less than a coffee a day for a full digital team working around the clock.</p>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-text-primary text-sm">
